WEBVTT

00:03:58.943 --> 00:04:02.488
And it looked like some army guy
with bulletproof jackets and heavily armed

00:04:02.530 --> 00:04:04.949
who say, "Alright, this is going
to be very simple.

00:04:04.949 --> 00:04:07.368
There's some people
waiting for you in a gymnasium.

00:04:07.368 --> 00:04:08.619
We gathered some inmates.

00:04:08.619 --> 00:04:10.871
You cannot approach them,
you cannot touch them.

00:04:10.913 --> 00:04:13.291
You can sit at the chair
that we designed for you,

00:04:13.332 --> 00:04:15.918
and we're going to surround
the area of the gymnasium."

00:04:15.918 --> 00:04:17.211
That sounds fun.

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:18.963
I enter the room,

00:04:18.963 --> 00:04:21.882
and we do this thing in France,
I don't know if you have that,

00:04:21.924 --> 00:04:23.759
but you shake people's hand, you know?

00:04:23.801 --> 00:04:27.221
So I started shaking people's hands,
"Hello, how are you? My name is JR.

00:04:27.221 --> 00:04:28.389
What's your name?"

00:04:28.431 --> 00:04:30.391
And go around the table, and then I sat.